  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* fix: prevent nil map panic when docker-compose.yaml has top-level name field by @raman1236 in https://github.com/devspace-sh/devspace/pull/3204\r\n* Adds check for websocket source by @zerbitx in https://github.com/devspace-sh/devspace/pull/3219\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @raman1236 made their first contribution in https://github.com/devspace-sh/devspace/pull/3204\r\n\r\n## Breaking Changes\r\n\r\nDevspace will no longer be published to NPM or Yarn, please continue to use our [other installation methods](https://www.devspace.sh/docs/getting-started/installation) to get updates in the future.\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/devspace-sh/devspace/compare/v6.3.20...v6.3.21",
